## REST APIs

All endpoints will be exposed under `/api/autota`:

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/api/autota/requests` | `POST` | Submit a new exam paper request (triggers Manager Agent) |
| `/api/autota/requests/{id}/status` | `GET` | Retrieve live status and execution logs of all agents |
| `/api/autota/papers/{id}` | `GET` | Retrieve the generated paper details (JSON structured questions) |
| `/api/autota/papers/{id}/review` | `POST` | Submit review (Approve / Reject & Revise with comments) |
| `/api/autota/papers/{id}/regenerate-question` | `POST` | Regenerate a single specific question (Feedback Loop trigger) |
| `/api/autota/papers/{id}/versions` | `GET` | Retrieve the paper's version history |

