## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- We will write a JUnit test class `AutoTaPipelineTest` to verify the parallel execution flow, error retries, and merging logic.
- We will verify that compiling and running the project executes successfully.

### Manual Verification
- We will use the browser subagent to walk through the entire professor creation flow, watch the live progress terminal, edit a generated question, request a revision, and publish the final paper!
